Pop-ups filtering (0.6.0)
-------------------------
extension/rules/popups.json (regenerated by pipeline/build_rules.py) derives
from three EasyList lists: "EasyList – Newsletter Notices", "EasyList – Chat
Widgets" and — app-install banner rules only — "EasyList – Notifications",
fetched from the uBlock Origin assets mirror of the EasyList project.

    EasyList
    https://github.com/easylist/easylist  (fanboy-addon)
    Dual-licensed: GNU GPL v3.0  OR  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0.

Used under the same CC BY-SA 3.0 option as the cookie rules. The short list of
chat-vendor launcher selectors in extension/src/content/popups.js (CHAT_SEED)
is Quell's own.

Quell does not bundle, fork, or copy source code from "I don't care about
cookies", "I still don't care about cookies", uBlock Origin, or AdGuard. Those
projects informed our understanding of the problem space only.
